===Etymology===
{{rfe|lang=ru|From {{etyl|orv|ru}} {{m|orv|хорошь}} (13th century). Cognate with {{etyl|uk|-}} {{m|uk|хоро́ший}}, {{etyl|be|-}} {{m|be|харашы́цца||to boast, to swagger}}. Further etymology unclear; probably originally abbreviated from the -шь form of {{m|ru|хоро́брый}}, hence cognate with {{m|ru|хра́брый||brave}}.}}

